Enable every phase by default (altdns + metasploit_integration no longer disabled)

All 13 phases in get_phase_order() now default to enabled in both the
FrameworkConfig defaults and config.json. Optional-tool phases self-skip
gracefully at task-build time when their binaries are absent.

Also made metasploit_integration scope-safe before enabling it: build_task_list()
now derives tasks from the engine-provided filtered snapshot (prior_findings)
instead of querying get_discovered_targets()/get_findings() on the live KB,
so stale targets from previous campaigns cannot resurface now that it runs
by default. Added build_tasks_from_findings() as the core synthesis helper.

- core/config.py: altdns, metasploit_integration -> enabled=True
- config.json: same
- phases/metasploit_integration.py: scoped snapshot + regression test
- tests/test_regressions.py: +1 test (scoped metasploit task list)